    rdfs:label "Persian MS 961" ;
    dct:date "1833" ;
    dct:description """Sānval Singh, son of Lālah Sawhar
                                [Sohar] Singh Khān completed this adbridged Persian
                            translation of ninety chapters ( adhāhiya ) of the
                            tenth book ( skandah =) of the Bhāgavat
                                Purāṇa , here entitled Khulāṣah-'i Tarjamah-'i
