fihrist:manuscript_6792 a mdhn:Manuscript ;
    rdfs:label "Persian MS 300" ;
    dct:description "Zartusht Bahrām Pazhdū (fl. 1278) , the author of metrical translations of the Ardāvīrāfnāmah (Book of Ardāvīrāf, see Rylands Persian MS 41 ) and Dāstān-i Changranghāchah-nāmah (Story of Changranghāchah, see Rylands Persian MS 301 ), redacted this versified account of the birth and life of the prophet Zoroaster , from an earlier, undated version ascribed to Kay Kā'ūs bin Kay Khusraw bin Dārā of Rayy ." ;
