    rdfs:label "Persian MS 639" ;
    dct:date "circa 27 Shavvāl 1184–14 Rabī‘ I 1190 AH (3 Feb. 1771–3 May 1776 CE)" ;
    dct:description """This incomplete, anonymously compiled anthology contains a mixture of Persian verse and prose, including a lexicon of places and people. 
