fihrist:manuscript_7332 a mdhn:Manuscript ;
    rdfs:label "Persian MS 824" ;
    dct:description """The Maʼās̲ir al-‘Umārā (Feats of the Princes) features
                     biographies of the eminent men of India from the establishment of the Mughal
                     dynasty down to the author's time. While unsigned and undated, this manuscript
                     expands Bilgrami's edition with 311 entries.""" ;
